            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carol"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I give this a 5 star cause it is delicious. I used less ingredients than the recipe calls for since I was making a small about. I used 1t balsamic vinegar, 1/3 orange juice, 1/4 lemon juice, juice from 1 lime, 1 mango and about 5 to 6 large strawberries. Ate this salsa w/nopal &amp; linaza tostadas. Try them they are really good.",
